  "discussion": {
    "headline": "dry, tranquil and beautiful autumn weather to last into next week",
    "dateLine": "12:30 p.m. Tuesday, October 20, 2026",
    "excerpt": "The first widespread frosts of the season occurred on Sunday and Monday mornings in Lancaster County. Sub-freezing temperatures were recorded in many outlying parts of northern MD and south-central PA each morning, and the growing season has officially ended. However, residents of the Lower Susquehanna Valley will be graced with an extended stretch of dry, tranquil and gorgeous autumn weather over the next 7-10 days. …",
